1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,415
A business may have reusable waste, but finding
a buyer is only

2
00:00:05,415 --> 00:00:09,760
the beginning. The real question is whether that
material meets

3
00:00:09,760 --> 00:00:13,671
the buyer's requirements. WasteRecast helps both
sides work through

4
00:00:13,671 --> 00:00:14,540
that decision.

5
00:00:14,786 --> 00:00:17,171
Buyers publish what they accept.

6
00:00:17,171 --> 00:00:19,557
Sellers describe what they have.

7
00:00:19,557 --> 00:00:23,852
Verified accounts manage their listings in
Firestore, with country

8
00:00:23,852 --> 00:00:28,146
filters and thirty-day expiry. Public directory
records stay separate.

9
00:00:28,146 --> 00:00:32,441
Here, we're demonstrating a clearly labelled
scenario, not real

10
00:00:32,441 --> 00:00:32,918
businesses.

11
00:00:33,164 --> 00:00:37,294
Our seller has polypropylene offcuts with two
percent moisture.

12
00:00:37,294 --> 00:00:40,965
The evidence passport records values, units,
source quotations,

13
00:00:40,965 --> 00:00:43,719
and whether a person reviewed them.

14
00:00:43,719 --> 00:00:46,931
Gemini can extract facts from optional
documents.

15
00:00:46,931 --> 00:00:51,062
Unreviewed or missing measurements stay unknown
until someone checks

16
00:00:51,062 --> 00:00:51,521
them.

17
00:00:51,766 --> 00:00:56,059
Retrieval combines material aliases, documented
process connections,

18
00:00:56,059 --> 00:01:00,353
and real Gemini embeddings for verified users.

19
00:01:00,353 --> 00:01:04,033
Reciprocal rank fusion combines these searches.

20
00:01:04,033 --> 00:01:09,553
This signed-out demonstration clearly shows its
alias and process

21
00:01:09,553 --> 00:01:13,846
fallback. Gemini then explains each candidate's
fit.

22
00:01:14,092 --> 00:01:18,400
The polymer matches, but moisture exceeds the
buyer's limit.

23
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:22,708
The material still fails. A sourced drying
investigation requires

24
00:01:22,708 --> 00:01:27,016
a trial, measured yield, a retest, and written
acceptance.

25
00:01:27,016 --> 00:01:30,367
We never assume that processing will work.

26
00:01:30,613 --> 00:01:34,190
Another buyer needs missing melt-flow evidence.

27
00:01:34,190 --> 00:01:41,939
That stays unknown. A P E T buyer is blocked by
incompatible polymer

28
00:01:41,939 --> 00:01:46,708
identity. AI scores cannot override these fixed
checks.

29
00:01:46,954 --> 00:01:51,453
Commercial feasibility is separate. These
illustrative costs total

30
00:01:51,453 --> 00:01:54,265
thirteen hundred and fifty euros.

31
00:01:54,265 --> 00:01:59,889
At ninety percent assumed usable yield, that
means three hundred

32
00:01:59,889 --> 00:02:05,513
euros per usable tonne, twenty euros above the
entered budget.

33
00:02:05,758 --> 00:02:11,088
The evaluation lab passes twenty-four authored
acceptance scenarios.

34
00:02:11,088 --> 00:02:15,751
They're test cases, not independent accuracy
results.

35
00:02:15,751 --> 00:02:19,082
Private reviewer annotations support scrutiny.

36
00:02:19,082 --> 00:02:25,744
Real sample trials and expert validation remain
our next step.

37
00:02:25,990 --> 00:02:31,570
A discussion brief carries the evidence and
unanswered questions.

38
00:02:31,570 --> 00:02:37,769
Nothing is sent automatically. The app also
offers sourced recovery

39
00:02:37,769 --> 00:02:42,109
leads, multilingual controls, themes, and
Recast's conversational

40
00:02:42,109 --> 00:02:42,729
assistant.

41
00:02:42,974 --> 00:02:48,432
Firebase hosts the app. Authentication and
Firestore support the

42
00:02:48,432 --> 00:02:52,677
exchange. Gemini powers extraction,
explanations, embeddings, and

43
00:02:52,677 --> 00:02:57,529
live conversation. Our private backend protects
the key.

44
00:02:57,529 --> 00:02:59,954
Try the public prototype.
